alse","unknown"]}},"required":["conditionId","value"],"additionalProperties":false}},"effect":{"type":"string","enum":["reachable","blocked","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"missingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"factIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["id","assumptions","effect","explanation","missingFacts","factIds"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["obligationId","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations","decision","branchResults"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":186,"output":1281,"cacheRead":10624,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_wY9FvWvqY8cNgqdKp8hC8j5l","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Atoken-status-unspecified::entry%3Aget-shared","decision":{"kind":"observed","observed":"unknown"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared entry, the concrete outcome cannot be selected because token existence and expiry are unspecified. Conditionally, when getActiveMemoShare resolves a non-expired token, GetSharedMemo loads the memo identified by that share, rejects missing/inactive/SPACE memos, builds an anonymous read context carrying the share's memo ID, and permits the exact non-SPACE memo because the share applies to that memo. The handler then proceeds to retrieve reactions and attachments and returns the memo, subject to those later store operations and conversion succeeding; those operational outcomes are not established by the premises. An invalid or expired token returns NOT_FOUND before memo retrieval. The specified entry also visibly maps a missing, non-normal, or SPACE memo to NOT_FOUND, and maps a failed or denied read check to NOT_FOUND. No separate requested memo identity is introduced by this source path, and no deployment or execution fact is inferred.","facts":[{"id":"entry-get-shared","kind":"entry","statement":"GetSharedMemo requires no authentication and begins by resolving an active share token.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":170,"endLine":175}]},{"id":"binding-anonymous-context","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler builds the memo read context through the current-user path, and the supplied premise establishes that the viewer at entry is anonymous.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-69d26d731760c05a","startLine":17,"endLine":29}]},{"id":"binding-exact-shared-memo","kind":"binding","statement":"The memo is fetched using the resolved share's MemoID, and that same MemoID is passed as the shared memo identity for the read check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":178,"endLine":186}]},{"id":"control-share-exact-memo","kind":"control","statement":"The read policy grants the share class only when the shared memo ID exactly equals the memo ID and the memo is not SPACE-audience.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":87,"endLine":92},{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":119,"endLine":122}]},{"id":"condition-valid-associated-memo","kind":"condition","statement":"Under the task premise, a resolved token is associated with an active, private, non-SPACE memo having a valid creator; the source's structural checks accept a valid creator, supported visibility, and normal lifecycle state before the share check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":92,"endLine":105}]},{"id":"effect-valid-share-read","kind":"effect","statement":"For a resolved token associated with the described memo, the exact-memo share branch yields an allowed read decision, so the handler passes its access check and proceeds toward returning the memo.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":119,"endLine":122},{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":186,"endLine":213}]},{"id":"effect-invalid-expired-token","kind":"effect","statement":"A missing share record or an expired share is returned as NOT_FOUND before the memo is fetched.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":216,"endLine":229}]},{"id":"effect-inaccessible-memo","kind":"effect","statement":"Within the specified entry, a missing memo, non-normal memo, or SPACE-audience memo returns NOT_FOUND; a failed or denied memo read check also returns NOT_FOUND.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":178,"endLine":188}]},{"id":"missing-token-existence","kind":"condition","statement":"It is not established whether the supplied token resolves to a share record.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":221,"endLine":229}]},{"id":"missing-token-expiry","kind":"condition","statement":"It is not established whether a resolved share has an expiry that has passed.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":216,"endLine":229}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["Whether Store.GetMemoShare finds a share record for the supplied token.","If a share record exists, whether its expiry is absent or has not passed at evaluation time."],"suggestedObservations":["Observe whether getActiveMemoShare resolves a non-nil share for the supplied token.","Observe the resolved share's ExpiresTs and the current evaluation time to determine whether isMemoShareExpired is false."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":186,"output":1281,"cacheRead":10624,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":76062.73249999993,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-28T18:27:15.394Z"}}
