en state. No separate requested memo identity, deployment fact, or execution result is inferred.","facts":[{"id":"entry-get-shared","kind":"entry","statement":"GetSharedMemo begins by resolving an active share token, and its declaration states that authentication is not required.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":170,"endLine":175}]},{"id":"binding-share-memo","kind":"binding","statement":"After token resolution, the handler fetches the memo by the resolved share's MemoID and passes that same ID as the shared-memo binding for the read check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":178,"endLine":186}]},{"id":"control-exact-share","kind":"control","statement":"The read decision grants the share branch only when the shared memo ID equals the memo ID and the memo is not SPACE-audience.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":87,"endLine":92},{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":119,"endLine":122}]},{"id":"condition-valid-memo","kind":"condition","statement":"The source requires a non-nil memo with a valid creator, supported visibility, and an acceptable lifecycle state before the share branch can allow the read.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":92,"endLine":105}]},{"id":"effect-valid-token","kind":"effect","statement":"For a resolved share associated with the described memo, the exact-memo share branch produces an allowed decision and the handler proceeds through reaction and attachment retrieval toward returning the memo.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":119,"endLine":122},{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":186,"endLine":213}]},{"id":"effect-invalid-expired","kind":"effect","statement":"A missing share record or an expired share causes NOT_FOUND before the memo lookup.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":216,"endLine":229}]},{"id":"effect-inaccessible","kind":"effect","statement":"Within the specified handler, a missing, non-normal, or SPACE-audience memo returns NOT_FOUND, and a failed or denied read check also returns NOT_FOUND.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":178,"endLine":188}]},{"id":"condition-token-existence-missing","kind":"condition","statement":"The supplied runtime context does not establish whether the token resolves to a share record.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":221,"endLine":229}]},{"id":"condition-token-expiry-missing","kind":"condition","statement":"The supplied runtime context does not establish whether a resolved share is expired at evaluation time.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":216,"endLine":229}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["Whether Store.GetMemoShare finds a share record for the supplied token.","If a share record exists, whether its ExpiresTs is absent or has not passed when evaluated."],"suggestedObservations":["Observe whether getActiveMemoShare returns a non-nil share for the supplied token.","If it returns a share, observe ExpiresTs together with the evaluation time to determine whether isMemoShareExpired is false."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":12307,"output":1186,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":50175.45999999996,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-28T18:28:05.575Z"}}
